{
    "comment": "알림 탭 본체. 읽음 처리는 이 목록만이 아니라 **헤더의 안 읽음 배지**도 함께 움직여야 해서,\n     응답 뒤 목록·개수 소스를 모두 다시 받고 전역 배지 값도 직접 0 으로 맞춘다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "마이페이지 알림 탭 - 시안 기반 반응형 레이아웃"
    },
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "blur_until_loaded": {
        "enabled": true,
        "data_sources": "userNotifications"
    },
    "responsive": {
        "portable": {
            "props": {
                "className": "mt-4"
            }
        }
    },
    "props": {
        "className": "mt-6"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "comment": "알림 헤더 바 - 반응형",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "responsive": {
                        "portable": {
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex flex-col gap-2 p-3 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex items-center justify-between p-4 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "comment": "좌측: 카운트 + 안 읽은 알림만 필터",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex items-center gap-4"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-sm text-red-500 dark:text-red-400 font-medium"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:mypage.notifications.unread_count|count={{notification_unread_count.data?.unread_count ?? 0}}"
                                },
                                {
                                    "comment": "안 읽은 알림만 필터 토글",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Label",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer select-none"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Input",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "«안 읽음만» 토글 — 조건이 전역이 아니라 로컬이라 스스로 다시 받아야 한다",
                                                    "type": "change",
                                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                                    "actions": [
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "target": "local",
                                                                "userNotificationsUnreadOnly": "{{$event.target.checked}}",
                                                                "notificationsPage": 1
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "dataSourceId": "userNotifications"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "checkbox",
                                                "checked": "{{_local.userNotificationsUnreadOnly ?? false}}",
                                                "className": "w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 text-blue-600 focus:ring-blue-500 cursor-pointer"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:mypage.notifications.unread_only"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "액션 버튼 그룹",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "responsive": {
                                "portable": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "flex items-center justify-end gap-3"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex items-center gap-3"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "읽지 않은 알림을 모두 읽음으로 표시한다. 목록이 비어 있으면 버튼 자체가 뜨지 않는다",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "if": "{{userNotifications.data.data && userNotifications.data.data.length > 0}}",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "apiCall",
                                            "target": "/api/user/notifications/read-all",
                                            "auth_required": true,
                                            "params": {
                                                "method": "POST"
                                            },
                                            "onSuccess": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "dataSourceId": "userNotifications"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "dataSourceId": "notification_unread_count"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "global",
                                                        "notificationCount": 0
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "onError": {
                                                "handler": "toast",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "type": "error",
                                                    "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "disabled": "{{userNotifications?.data?.abilities?.can_update !== true}}",
                                        "title": "{{userNotifications?.data?.abilities?.can_update === true ? '' : '$t:mypage.notifications.no_permission'}}"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:mypage.notifications.mark_all_read"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "if": "{{userNotifications.data.data && userNotifications.data.data.length > 0}}",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "openModal",
                                            "target": "notification_delete_all_confirm_modal"
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-sm text-red-500 dark:text-red-400 hover:text-red-600 dark:hover:text-red-300 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "disabled": "{{userNotifications?.data?.abilities?.can_delete !== true}}",
                                        "title": "{{userNotifications?.data?.abilities?.can_delete === true ? '' : '$t:mypage.notifications.no_permission'}}"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:mypage.notifications.delete_all"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "알림 목록",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{userNotifications.data.data && userNotifications.data.data.length > 0}}",
                    "iteration": {
                        "source": "{{userNotifications.data.data ?? []}}",
                        "item_var": "notification"
                    },
                    "props": {
                        "className": "divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "comment": "알림 아이템 - 반응형",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "responsive": {
                                "portable": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "p-3 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800/50 transition-colors cursor-pointer {{notification.read_at ? '' : 'bg-red-50/30 dark:bg-red-900/10'}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "apiCall",
                                            "target": "/api/user/notifications/{{notification.id}}/read",
                                            "if": "{{!notification.read_at && userNotifications?.data?.abilities?.can_update === true}}",
                                            "auth_required": true,
                                            "params": {
                                                "method": "PATCH"
                                            },
                                            "onSuccess": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "dataSourceId": "notification_unread_count"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "global",
                                                        "notificationCount": "{{Math.max(0, (_global.notificationCount ?? 0) - 1)}}"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "onError": {
                                                "handler": "toast",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "type": "error",
                                                    "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "comment": "audit:allow layout-list-context-navigate-merge-query 알림 대상으로 이동 — 목적지는 알림이 지정한 임의 화면이므로 알림 목록 클러스터 밖이다.",
                                            "handler": "navigate",
                                            "if": "{{notification.url}}",
                                            "params": {
                                                "path": "{{notification.url}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "className": "p-4 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800/50 transition-colors cursor-pointer {{notification.read_at ? '' : 'bg-red-50/30 dark:bg-red-900/10'}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "flex items-start gap-3"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "읽지 않음 표시 + 아이콘",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "flex items-center gap-2 flex-shrink-0"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "읽지 않음 빨간 점",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                    "if": "{{!notification.read_at}}",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 dark:bg-red-400"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "타입 아이콘",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                    "responsive": {
                                                        "portable": {
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center {{notification.type === 'order' ? 'bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30' : notification.type === 'comment' ? 'bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30' : notification.type === 'shipping' ? 'bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30' : notification.type === 'promotion' ? 'bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30' : 'bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700'}}"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center {{notification.type === 'order' ? 'bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30' : notification.type === 'comment' ? 'bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30' : notification.type === 'shipping' ? 'bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30' : notification.type === 'promotion' ? 'bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30' : 'bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700'}}"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Icon",
                                                            "responsive": {
                                                                "portable": {
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "name": "{{notification.type === 'order' ? 'shopping-cart' : notification.type === 'comment' ? 'message-square' : notification.type === 'shipping' ? 'truck' : notification.type === 'promotion' ? 'gift' : 'bell'}}",
                                                                        "className": "text-base {{notification.type === 'order' ? 'text-green-600 dark:text-green-400' : notification.type === 'comment' ? 'text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400' : notification.type === 'shipping' ? 'text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400' : notification.type === 'promotion' ? 'text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400' : 'text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'}}"
                                                                    }
                                                                }
                                                            },
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "name": "{{notification.type === 'order' ? 'shopping-cart' : notification.type === 'comment' ? 'message-square' : notification.type === 'shipping' ? 'truck' : notification.type === 'promotion' ? 'gift' : 'bell'}}",
                                                                "className": "text-xl {{notification.type === 'order' ? 'text-green-600 dark:text-green-400' : notification.type === 'comment' ? 'text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400' : notification.type === 'shipping' ? 'text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400' : notification.type === 'promotion' ? 'text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400' : 'text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'}}"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "comment": "알림 내용",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "flex-1 min-w-0"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "제목 + 태그 + 삭제 버튼",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Div",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0"
                                                            },
                                                            "children": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white truncate {{notification.read_at ? '' : 'font-semibold'}}"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "text": "{{notification.subject ?? ''}}"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "comment": "타입 태그 — type_label은 BE의 NotificationDefinition.name(다국어)에서 해석된 값. 미정의 type은 식별자 fallback",
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                                    "if": "{{notification.type_label}}",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "flex-shrink-0 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs rounded {{notification.type === 'order' ? 'bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/50 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300' : notification.type === 'comment' ? 'bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300' : notification.type === 'shipping' ? 'bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/50 text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-300' : notification.type === 'promotion' ? 'bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/50 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300' : 'bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300'}}"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "text": "{{notification.type_label}}"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "comment": "삭제 버튼",
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Button",
                                                            "actions": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "click",
                                                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                                                    "target": "/api/user/notifications/{{notification.id}}",
                                                                    "auth_required": true,
                                                                    "params": {
                                                                        "method": "DELETE"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "onSuccess": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                "dataSourceId": "userNotifications"
                                                                            }
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                "dataSourceId": "notification_unread_count"
                                                                            }
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                                            "if": "{{!notification.read_at}}",
                                                                            "params": {
                                                                                "target": "global",
                                                                                "notificationCount": "{{Math.max(0, (_global.notificationCount ?? 0) - 1)}}"
                                                                            }
                                                                        }
                                                                    ],
                                                                    "onError": {
                                                                        "handler": "toast",
                                                                        "params": {
                                                                            "type": "error",
                                                                            "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                                                        }
                                                                    },
                                                                    "stopPropagation": true
                                                                }
                                                            ],
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "aria-label": "$t:common.delete",
                                                                "title": "{{userNotifications?.data?.abilities?.can_delete === true ? '$t:common.delete' : '$t:mypage.notifications.no_permission'}}",
                                                                "className": "flex-shrink-0 p-1.5 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 hover:text-red-500 dark:hover:text-red-400 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                                                "type": "button",
                                                                "disabled": "{{userNotifications?.data?.abilities?.can_delete !== true}}"
                                                            },
                                                            "children": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "name": "trash-can",
                                                                        "className": "text-base"
                                                                    }
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "알림 메시지",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "P",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{notification.body ?? ''}}"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "날짜",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{notification.created_at | datetime}}"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "알림 없음",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!userNotifications.data.data || userNotifications.data.data.length === 0}}",
                    "responsive": {
                        "portable": {
                            "props": {
                                "className": "p-8 text-center"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "props": {
                        "className": "p-12 text-center"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "bell-off",
                                "className": "text-5xl mx-auto text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 mb-3"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:mypage.notifications.empty"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "페이지네이션",
                    "type": "composite",
                    "name": "Pagination",
                    "if": "{{((userNotifications.data.last_page ?? 0) > 1) || (userNotifications.data.has_more_pages === true) || ((userNotifications.data.current_page ?? 1) > 1)}}",
                    "responsive": {
                        "portable": {
                            "props": {
                                "currentPage": "{{userNotifications.data.current_page}}",
                                "totalPages": "{{userNotifications.data.last_page ?? null}}",
                                "hasMorePages": "{{userNotifications.data.has_more_pages ?? false}}",
                                "className": "p-3 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "event": "onPageChange",
                            "handler": "sequence",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "local",
                                        "notificationsPage": "{{$args[0]}}"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                    "params": {
                                        "dataSourceId": "userNotifications"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "currentPage": "{{userNotifications.data.current_page}}",
                        "totalPages": "{{userNotifications.data.last_page ?? null}}",
                        "hasMorePages": "{{userNotifications.data.has_more_pages ?? false}}",
                        "className": "p-4 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700"
                    }
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
